The SCEPTRE module now records ``analog-output`` and ``holding-register`` points as registers, as well as the points that client configs list under each ``<x-connection>`` element, which were previously dropped. The SCEPTRE field device parsing tests are re-enabled and now cover all example configs from `sceptre-bennu <https://github.com/sandialabs/sceptre-bennu>`__ and the SOAP topology RTU configs from `sceptre-phenix-topologies <https://github.com/sandialabs/sceptre-phenix-topologies>`__.
